# cip-68-444-minting enclave: files whose change needs operator approval before merging to a protected branch.
# Active when merged at the repo root (read by kora-bot merge_pr). Exact repo-root-relative paths, no wildcards.
# Scope (operator decision 2, 2026-10-13): exact on-chain Aiken/Helios source, plus this manifest and CANONICAL_CONTRACT.md.
# Tests, npm/JS/TS, builders, config, generated artifacts and workflows follow normal agent review.
# Limit: path-only matching cannot tell embedded Aiken test blocks from production code in a listed file.
# Why each path: CANONICAL_CONTRACT.md.

